# Suricata Local NIDS Rules for Layer-2 ARP Anomaly Detection
# Author: Arslan Wali
# Reference: An Empirical Study on Layer-2 Station Isolation Deficits (2026)

# Rule SID 1000001: Rate-thresholded inbound ARP reply monitor (5 pkts in 5s = > 1.0 Hz)
alert arp any any -> any any (msg:"LOCAL POLICY Suspicious Inbound ARP Reply Rate"; threshold: type both, track by_src, count 5, seconds 5; classtype:bad-unknown; sid:1000001; rev:1;)
